### === LUỒNG GHI (app khách) — cần header X-Api-Key ===

### Heartbeat
POST http://localhost:8080/device/heartbeat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: dev-device-key-doi-o-production

{
  "deviceId": "pixel-8-abc123",
  "model": "Pixel 8",
  "appVersion": "1.0.0"
}

### Log event (xử lý xong 1 tin nhắn)
POST http://localhost:8080/event/logEvent
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: dev-device-key-doi-o-production

{
  "deviceId": "pixel-8-abc123",
  "category": "spam",
  "latencyMs": 320,
  "hasError": false
}

### === LUỒNG ĐỌC (admin) — cần JWT ===

### 1) Login lấy token
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2) Danh sách device (thay <TOKEN> bằng token ở bước trên)
GET http://localhost:8080/device/list
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### 3) Danh sách event (có lọc + phân trang)
GET http://localhost:8080/event/listEvents?page=0&size=50&hasError=false
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
